window.products.push({"id":73089,"name":"R.W.FLAME Chest Freezer, Deep Freezer 7.0 Cu.ft. w/Removable Basket, Adjustable Temperature, Energy Saving, Top Open Door Compact Freezer, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417s75+9tyS._AC_.jpg","description":"🧊【7 Cu.ft Capacity with 1 Basket】The 7.0 cu.ft chest freezer offers plenty of freezing space for you to store a considerable amount of frozen food, especially those bulky ones, like turkeys, ribs and pizzas. And there is one removable basket provided. You can put small items in this basket and every time you open the freezer, they are always within your reach. 🧊【Thermostat Control & Manual Defrosting】The chest freezer is designed with 7 temperatures for freezing different items according to your needs. It can be adjusted from -7.6℉ to 6.8℉ (-14℃~-22℃). And the “0” on thermostat dial means shutting down the compressor to stop cooling. Besides, you can defrost with the shovel provided. 🧊【Flip-up Lid with Sealing Strip】This deep chest freezer has a flip-up lid that is connected by premium hinges for smooth lift. And the lid is integrated with sealing strips to achieve better thermal insulation effect. 🧊【Efficient & Quiet Cooling System】The chest freezer adopts an energy-efficient compressor that only consumes 0.7 kWh per day, greatly saving your electricity bill. What’s more, the compressor works at a noise level ≤ 40 dB, so no matter day or night, it will not affect your normal work and rest. 🧊【Compact size & Wide Application】The overall dimension of this deep freezer is 36.89” x 22.05” x 32.6” (L x W x H). It has a sleek appearance and is suitable for being embedded in various corners to save space. You can put it in your apartment, garage, basement and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417s75+9tyS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"R.W.FLAME","source_asin":"B097BK1LPR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-73089","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097BK1LPR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B097BK1LPR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
