window.products.push({"id":73101,"name":"Kitchen Aid KSGB900ESS 6.5 Cu. Ft. Slide-In Stainless Steel Gas Range KSGB900ESS","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Pwt4rDwgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This versatile gas range provides a Baking Drawer that adds more options to the oven. The separate compartment allows you to bake at a different temperature. This range features flawless cooking results from Even-Heat True Convection. The unique bow-tie design and convection fan ensure the entire oven is heated to and stays at the perfect temperature. It also has a Wireless Probe that allows you to read internal food temperatures even when you re away from the kitchen. Baking Drawer Adds more cooking options to the oven. The separate compartment allows you to keep warm slow cook or bake at a different temperature and keep dishes warm. Even-Heat True Convection Produces flawless results. The unique bow-tie design and convection fan ensure the inside of the entire oven is heated to and stays at the perfect temperature. Wireless Probe Lets cooks walk away from the oven without walking away from control. Our probe can easily be set to specific temperatures and alerts you when the desired temperature has been reached. The easy-to-read monitor lets you attend to the rest of the meal or anything else. Additional Features Steam Rack Offers the ability to provide additional moisture to the inside of the oven enhancing cooking results. 6.5 Cu Ft Total Capacity This slide-in range provides an extra-large cooking capacity in the oven for multiple dishes at once and gives you the flexibility of a separate temperature zone in the baking drawer. 5 Burners Provides the perfect range of cooking power from 5 000 to19 000 BTU so you can go from a rolling boil to a delicate simmer. EasyConvect Conversion Takes guesswork out of convection cooking by converting conventional settings for recipes to convection settings for you. Fit Guarantee Is our promise to flawlessly fit slide-in ranges designed for an existing cutout of 30 width countertop depth of 24 -25 cabinet depth of 23 -24 and countertop height of 36 . Aqualift Cleans your oven in less than an hour without od","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Pwt4rDwgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenAid","source_asin":"B00VCWTH4K","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-73101","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00VCWTH4K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00VCWTH4K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":73102,"name":"COSTWAY Countertop Ice Maker, 26LBS/24H with Self-clean Function, LCD Display, 9 Bullet Ice / 7 Mins, Portable and Compact Ice Machine with Ice Scoop ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eKO9+5L9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍹【Easy to Adjust Ice Cube Size】 With small or large size options for bullet shape ice, the smart ice machine meets your all kinds of needs for ice cubes: iced food, smoothies, beverages, emergency use, etc. The high-end LCD display and practical control panel status indicators and adjustment buttons, which are fully functional and easy to operate. 🍹【Efficient Ice Making in 7 Minutes】Featuring high efficiency compressor and R134a refrigerant, the portable ice maker cools faster and makes up to 26 lbs of bullet-shaped ice cubes per 24 hours. The electric ice making machine offers 9 chewable and clean ice cubes in one cycle, in just 7 to 8 minute. 🍹【Self-Cleaning & Superior Material】The countertop ice machine features a self cleaning function that greatly facilitates your daily maintenance work. Made of food grade corrosion resistant ABS and PP material, the ice maker not only ensures harmless to the human body, but also has a smooth surface for effortless clean up. 🍹【Compact and Portable Ice Machine】Due to the compact size and light weight, the ice maker will not occupy too much countertop space. And since it’s portable, flexible and easy to store, you can bring the ice cube maker nearly anywhere, such as party, gathering, RV, bar or home and so on, ready for you whatever frosty fun you want. 🍹【User-friendly Design】The ETL certificated electric ice making machine comes with an ice scoop and a removable ice basket, providing you with everything you need for the ice adventures. In addition, you can see the ice making process directly through the big transparent full-view-window.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eKO9+5L9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSTWAY","source_asin":"B085XS8ZTH","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-73102","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085XS8ZTH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B085XS8ZTH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
