window.products.push({"id":73165,"name":"NewAir Stone Brewing 180 Can FlipShelf Beverage and Beer Refrigerator, 24” Built-In or Freestanding Wine Cooler with Reversible Shelves, Perfect for B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":499.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A6WVvA-UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Benefits 1. The Most Customizable Fridge on the Market The Newair Stone Brewing Company FlipShelf Beverage Refrigerator and Cooler is simply the best built-in fridge for people with varied tastes. Four sturdy racks slide out easily and can be flipped to accommodate both cans and bottles. With a flat and rounded side, each of the four FlipShelf™ racks give you options for storing the full range of year-round Stone IPAs and special releases. 2. Convenient Built-In or Freestanding Installation This versatile 24\" wine and beer fridge is perfectly sized to slide into standard kitchen cabinets for a seamless built-in look. The quiet, bottom-mounted compressor lets you upgrade your kitchen or bar with ease. Don't want to redesign your cabinetry? The Stone Brewing FlipShelf™ Beverage and Wine Refrigerator also works as a freestanding model in any room of the house. 3. Precision Digital Thermostat This beverage refrigerator features easy-to-use digital controls that give you total command of your cooling. Turn it down to 45°F for to keep Stone FMLs at optimal aroma and flavor. With a temperature range of 37°F-65°F, you can keep your favorite IPAs ready to serve — whether you're hosting a dinner party or just kicking back after a long day. 4. Effortless Good Looks With its clean, modern design, this isn't your basic college dorm fridge! This under counter cooler features Stone Brewing Company’s classic gargoyle logo in bright white on the side panel and company branding on the door. The triple-paned glass door lets you show off your collection of Stone® Brewing’s fresh, bold beers while sealing in cold air for maximum efficiency.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A6WVvA-UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NewAir","source_asin":"B0C5N1LNC6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-73165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5N1LNC6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5N1LNC6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
