window.products.push({"id":73196,"name":"SUPER DEAL Portable Washer Mini Twin Tub Washing Machine 17.6 lbs w/78.8'' Inlet Hose, Gravity Drain Pump, For Camping, Apartments, Dorms, College Roo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yl8-nDWDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FAQ: ( all the answers are provided by our customers) 1.Is it loud? No not at all, very quiet and holds its own. I love this little machine.   2.Does the spinner actually DRY the clothes or just spin out the extra soap and residue? It actually DRY the clothes.   3.When draining it, can you drain it in your kitchen sink, or does the hose need to be lower then the washer to drain? The hose would need to be lower than the washer, as it drains via gravity. I usually lift mine up and tilt it around a bit to make sure all the water is out when I’m done.   4.how Will you know when it’s at it’s weight limit? I just followed the recommended amounts, plus think about what something weighs when it is wet, like 2 pairs of jeans or some shirts, that is how I decide how much to put in. I have had no problems yet and it really does work great.   5. Can you do a wash cycle and spin dry cycle at same time or is the drain the same for both? Would it cause the water to prematurely drain from washer? Yes you can do it at the same time .. I absolutely love this since I live in a small apartment works great We pay attention to every detail: Wash timer - 0/6/9/12/15 min, 5 options for you to choose  Three washing modes - Standard/Drain/Soft, preset modes and feel free to pause at anytime Spin Timer - Select the dehydration time to reduce the wear and tear on the clothes Water Inlet hose - Upgraded extra longer hose for your convenient use Drain hose - You can easily hang the hose to prevent it from being stepped on the floor. Filter net - Filter on the side of the washing barrel, which can easily storage the dirty when washing, and you could easily pull it off when cleaning the tube.  Cover plate - when you use the spin tube, put it above the clothes to protect them from being thrown away at high speed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yl8-nDWDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Super Dea","source_asin":"B07G14ZGXV","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-73196","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G14ZGXV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G14ZGXV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
