window.products.push({"id":73201,"name":"Upgraded W10144820 Washer Water Inlet Valve with Installation Tools,Compatible with whirlpool Washing Machine Replacement Part Replace WPW10144820,AP6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.18,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cu0Fuq+YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💦【PERFECT COMPATIBILITY】Package Includes： W10144820 water inlet valve×1，Practical Toolkit*1.Compatible with: whirlpool, roper, kenmore,admiral, metag, real estate, crossley, Inglis brandsvv brands etc. Directly replaces with AP6015761, WPW10144820, AP4371093, PS2347919, W10311458, PS11749042,W10311458,etc.If you don’t know whether it is compatible, we are happy to help you inquire. 💦【HIGH QUALITY】W10144820 water valve is made of high quality material with increased thread thickness for enhanced sealing. Special treatment at the wiring to prevent water leakage and short circuit. It has undergone rigorous functional testing before leaving the factory to maximize its service life. Although this is not an OEM W10144820 washer water inlet valve, it will fit and work perfectly, like the original. 💦【EASY TO INSTALL】W10144820 water inlet valve is used in washing machines. Using the kit we come with, this can help make installation very easy and you don't need to purchase additional tools for a quick repair. Before installation search on YouTube to watch the installation video. Before starting work, turn off the electrical connections to the unit, keep away from surrounding water and electrical connections, and work with dry hands. 💦【SOLVE YOUR WORRIES】W10144820 washer water inlet valve has the function of balancing hot and cold water temperatures, controlling water levels and draining water. Replacement W10144820 water inlet valve is ideal if your washer is slow to fill, noisy, overflows or stops during the cycle. 💦【AFTER SALE GUARANTEE】Our W10144820 water inlet valve is backed by a one-year warranty that exceeds industry standards. If for any reason you are not satisfied, please click the \"Ask a Question\" button on our storefront or click \"Contact Seller\" in the \"Your Order\" option and you can promptly contact us for a refund. No matter what the problem is, we will give you a satisfactory answer within 24 hours. We always offer you products with the highest quality and the best price.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cu0Fuq+YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Azdele","source_asin":"B091BZ98YS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-73201","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091BZ98YS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B091BZ98YS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
