window.products.push({"id":73310,"name":"279838 W10724237 Dryer Heating Element Assembly by Beaquicy - Replacement for Whirlpool Ken-more Dryer - 4531017 Dryer Heating Element - Replaces 3398","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qwfjC6-+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【279838 DRYER HEATING ELEMENT】-- Includes 1 x 279838 dryer heating element assembly.The coil on the heating element accepts and resists the controlled current, thus heating the wire.The heat generated is used to dry the clothes in the dryer.279838 Dryer heating element assembly contains 85% chromium and the length of the heating wire is 25% longer than other replacement parts of the ordinary dryer.It is rated at 5,400 watts and 240 volts and has a 2-5/16 \"male terminal. ✅【HIGH QUALITY NICKEL CHROMIUM ALLOY】-- 279838 Dryer heating element assembly includes the housing with the heating element coil and insulators attached. The heating coil is made of an alloy of nickel and chromium.It has a high resistance that prevents itself from breaking and burning out. The insulators are made of high-tem-perature ceramic. They are firmlymounted into the frame to hold theheating coil, which will not come looseunder the vibration of a running machine. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】-- Product whirl-pool 279838 dryer heating element assembly support 365 days RETURN and EXCHANGE. Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of every customer. No risk shopping, warranty period, if there is any quality problem, please contact customer service.We will try our best to solve the problem. It can address the following symptoms:①not enough heat,②dryer takes too,③long to dry,④when drver overheats cannot be turnedoff automatically. ✅【COMPATIBILITY】-- 279838 Dryer heating element replacement for Whirl-pool, Ken-more, Cro-wley, Ro-per, Est-ate, Am-ana, Adm-iral and more brand dryers. ♦Replaces part numbers: W10724237, 2438, 279837, 279838A, 279838VP, 3398064, 3403585, 8565582, AP3094254. ♦Compatible with the following models: 11096560200, 1037777000, 1037777020, 7EWED1510YM0, 7EWED1705YM0, 7EWED1705YM1, 7EWED1730YW0, LEN2000LW0, RES7745RQ0, RED4100SQ0, 7MMEP0080WW0, AED4370TQ0, AED4470TQ0, IP80000, CEDX463JQ0,etc. ✅【EASY TO INSTALL】-- Beaquicy DIY Replacement Parts For Dryers are easy and quick to install, and you can do it independently with YouTube videos that take no more than 30 minutes to change.Before installing 279838 Dryer heating element,disconnect the power supply to the dryer. Remove back panel of dryer. Locate heating element lower right corner. Remove wires and temp guage from old part and apply to new part. Three screws hold part in place.Install back panel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qwfjC6-+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B083S5L257","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-73310","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083S5L257","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B083S5L257","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
