window.products.push({"id":73326,"name":"Broan-NuTone 424204 42-inch Under-Cabinet Range Hood with 2-Speed Exhaust Fan and Light, Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614aG88eYaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Upgrade your kitchen with the Broan-NuTone 42-inch Under-Cabinet Convertible Internal Blower Range Hood! This versatile range hood insert offers a complete solution to your ventilation needs by providing both an exhaust fan and overhead light for your stove. This range hood provides a MAX 230 CFM and 6.0 Sones blower performance to quickly remove smoke and cooking odors from the air, and the 4-speed rotary dial allows for quick fan adjustments and provides the ideal level of ventilation every time you cook. The variable speed control remembers the last setting used for convenience, and the heat sentry detects excessive heat and adjusts blower speed automatically. The two-level built-in lights accept up to 50-watt halogen bulbs (not included) to evenly illuminate your cooking area. This sleek stainless steel range hood fits neatly underneath cabinets, and it features mitered sides and a hemmed bottom with no sharp edges to help ensure safety and provide a more decorative look. The three one-piece dishwasher-safe baffle filters with removable grease drip rail offers easy cleaning so you can maintain optimum grease capture and keep your kitchen ventilated. This convertible range hood unit measures 22\" x 42\" x 10\" with a 3.25\" x 10\" ducted opening that is designed to duct out of the hood shell in either horizontal or vertical direction with internal blowers. It is both UL-Listed and HVI-2100 Certified for safety and protection, and it includes a 1 year limited warranty. Enhance your kitchen with the Broan-NuTone 424204 Range Hood! From the Manufacturer The 42000 series offers an effective and durable under-the-cabinet hood solution for vertical discharge installations. The range hood is designed for 7-Inch round vertical duct attachment. The hood comes in a variety of appliance matching colors and widths, and features a fan designed for years of trouble free service, an easy to clean grease filter, an easy to clean grease filter, a protective lamp lens that distributes light evenly over the cook-top and control switches for fan speed and light activation. Includes built-in 7-Inch duct adapter. Installs as 7-Inch round ducted only. 190 CFM, 6.0 Sone (vertical discharge) performance - HVI 2100 Certified. Dishwasher-safe aluminum grease filter. Accepts up to 75-watt light. Bulb not included. Built-in 7-Inch adapter. BP87 dampers sold separately. This range hood can work in an ADA-compliant application.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614aG88eYaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Broan-NuTone","source_asin":"B0BSV3RK3X","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-73326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSV3RK3X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSV3RK3X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
