window.products.push({"id":73422,"name":"PUREPLUS 469690 NSF 401 & 473 & 53 & 42 Certified Replacement for LG LT700P Kenmore Elite 9690, ADQ36006102, ADQ36006101, LFXS30766S, LFX28968ST, LT12","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WfXG-QSmS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️NSF/ANSI 401 & 473 Certified -This filter is certified against NSF/ANSI 401by IAPMO, filtering out 96.8% of PFOA & PFOS, 99.47% of Phenytoin, 97.57% of Ibuprofen, 99.15% of Naproxen, 99.30% of Estrone, 99.49% of Bisphenol A, 99.39% of Nonylphenol, protect you from harmful substances. Only select products with authoritative certifications for your households. ❄️NSF/ANSI 53 Certified -This filter is certified against NSF/ANSI 53 by NSF for Heavy Metal reduction, filtering out 99.6% of Lead, 89.3% of Mercury and significantly improving water taste. ❄️NSF/ANSI 42&372 Certified -This filter is certified against NSF/ANSI 42 and 372 Lead-Free by NSF, filtering out 97.5% of Chlorine, odor. It is also certified by the European TUV, ROHS, REACH, Canadian CSA, BPA Free and Australian Water Mark. ❄️Compatible Models - OEM LT700PC, KENMORECLEAR 46-9690, ADQ36006102-S, GENUINE ADQ36006102S, ADQ36006101-S, ADQ36006101S, WD-LT700P, WSL-3, R-9690, PL-500, MB-LT700P, KJ700, RWF1200AH, SEARS HDX FML-3, RWF1200A, GS-L3, WF-117, FL-RF32, PURE WF-LT700P, CF15, AQF-LT700P, LT700P, RWF1052 FRIDGE CARTRIDGE, AIR FILTER: 46-9918, ADQ73214404. ❄️Fits LG KENMORE Refrigerators - LFDS22520S, LFX21976ST, LFX25978ST, LFX25991ST, LFX28968ST, LFX28978ST, LFX31925ST, LFX31945ST, LFXC24726, LFXC24726D, LFXC24726S, LFXC24726S/03, LFXS24623S, LFXS29626S, LFXS29766S, LFXS30726S, LMXS27626S. ❄️Innovative Multi-Layer Filtration Integrated Molding Tech -This Multi-layer technology offers different levels of filtration efficiency in filtering out different contaminants. The 0.5 Micron inner layer is effective against 99.99% of Chlorine and meets Particular Reduction Class I standards. This filter retains beneficial minerals in water which is good for your health. ❄️Why PUREPLUS -PUREPLUS has 20 years of expertise and 200 patents in the water filtration industry. Every year it provides filtration solutions to more than 200 million American households, our filters use advanced filtration technology to ensure high quality water. Trust us, make PUREPLUS your solution. ❄️Strict Quality Control -All products are produced under the ISO9001, 14000 standard and inspected under strict quality control. Each filter is produced through 34 production processes, 400PSI pressure test, 10,000 water hammer tests, and 6 independent tests. ❄️Cost-Effective -PUREPLUS is the most cost-effective brand. It sells 600 million filters in America every year, and can provide you with the best filtration performance at a more reasonable price. ❄️No Leakage -PUREPLUS filters have been manufactured to the exact designs and specifications as the original brand name filter to ensure perfect compatibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WfXG-QSmS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PUREPLUS","source_asin":"B08F7PG8MQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-73422","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F7PG8MQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F7PG8MQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
