window.products.push({"id":73492,"name":"Ice Maker icefeast counter top ice Machine with High Efficiency Low Noise Low Energy 2 Cube Sizes 54 pounds Ice Per Day No Plumbing New Portable Easy ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K3fV+oT1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The ice maker is not only portable, it also helps to save power and space. How to use your ice maker 1.Start with the middle button after turning on the power supply,the machine began to run.  2.Open the cover, remove the ice basket and pour water into the tank keep the water level below the basket then close the lid.(The lowest water is 40mm,80mm as high injection.)  3. While the ice maker is on ,check water level periodically.If water pump can’t inject water, the ice maker will stop automatically, and the “water” indicator will be on. Press “ON/OFF” button, fill water up to the level mark and press “ON/OFF” again. 4. The ice maker automatically stops working when the ice basket is full.The “ice full” would be light when ice cube location is below the infrared detection location, the machine would rework. 5.Change water in the water reservoir every 24 hours to ensure a reasonable hygiene level. *Information: The first three cycles will cost 10 minutes for ice making. After that, each cycle will cost 6minutes and 30 seconds for ice making (Ice making time and size are depend on the temperature of environment and water). Each circle will come out with nine bullet-shaped ice cubes. Specification Ice maker size: 13.6 x 13.6 x 15.7 inches Ice production: 54 lbs of 24 hours Ice time: Ready in 6 - 8 minutes Power: 110V / 60Hz Smooth bullet-shaped ice cubes Auto shut off when ice is full Easy to fill and drain water quickly Simple-to-use control panel Comes with small ice scoop and removable ice basket Notes * Quality claims due to non arbitrary damage in a period of 12 months in eligible for free replacement by our company.  * The main part (compressor) is warranted for three-year repair. Package contents 1 x Ice Scoop 1 x Ice maker 1 x User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K3fV+oT1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ICEFEAST","source_asin":"B079GGL7HQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-73492","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079GGL7HQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B079GGL7HQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
