window.products.push({"id":73506,"name":"Hosile 72\" Flexible Gas Line Kit for Dryer, Stove, Range, Stainless Steel Gas Dryer Connector Kit, 5/8 in.OD(1/2 in. ID）Dryer Gas Line with Connector ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MbJ6MMHwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Kit Content & Size】72\" gas dryer installation kit has an outside dimension of 5/8\", and inner diameter 1/2\". gas line connector adapter: 2 Pcs 15/16\" -16 UN to 1/2\" FIP, 2 Pcs 15/16\"- 16 UN to 1/2\" MIP(Tapped 3/8\" FIP ), 2Pcs 15/16\"-16 UN to 3/4\" MIP(Tapped 1/2\" FIP ), Six thread adapter fitting in total. and 1 set threaded tape. 【Wide Application】Our flexible gas line designed for gas dryer, gas stove,gas range, etc. It has an thicker pipe diameter can provide more gas, optimal flow rate up to 106K BTU flow capacity. And the threaded connectors are suitable for most conventional equipment. NOTE: Please check the connector adapter size carefully to make sure that they fits your machine. 【Corrugated Design】Stainless steel gas dryer installation kit is designed with corrugation, for better use in a narrow range. The corrugated pipe has high level flexibility, it can go anywhere. At the same time, the bright yellow rind also improved identification. 【Easy to Install】No need for more connectors, just make sure your sizing fits our dryer gas line, only one wrench and a little bit teflon tape are all you need. Trust me, no more than 2 minutes, Easily connect your appliance to your gas duct with ease. 【Premium Quality】Gas dryer connector kit is made of durable materials, with excellent flexibility, high and low-temperature resistance, etc. In addition, our dryer gas line kit is 100% Leak Tested, It has good air tightness, durability, rust and corrosion resistance, so, it is duable and longevity. 【Excellent After-sales Service】If you have any problems about our gas line, please tell us, our service team will help you out within 24 hours. Additionally, you can enjoy dryer gas line warranty within 1 year during which you can claim replacement or refund if the gas line has any quality-related issues.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MbJ6MMHwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hosile","source_asin":"B0972Q5KFV","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-73506","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0972Q5KFV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0972Q5KFV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
