window.products.push({"id":73737,"name":"EcoPeaceful 2 Pack (6.5\" x 10\") 100% Organic Cotton Cold Brew Coffee Bags Reusable Unbleached - Ultra Fine Coffee Filter Bags w/Drawstring & Silicone ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ENZerOlML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hi, I'm Lena CEO of Eco Peaceful, LLC After watching several plastic documentaries, I was shocked at how plastic affects wildlife & humans. I decided to change my lifestyle. I started growing my own food to reduce plastic packaging & started a zero-waste organic, plastic-free business in 2012. My first product was a organic nut milk bag since I could not find any bag that was without synthetics, even GOTS (Global Organic Textile Standard) certified bags are sewn with polyester threads. So, I had to learn sewing & how to run a business.  ✔️ ALL 100% ORGANIC : fabric, stitches, loop & drawstring made from 100% certified organic cotton, undyed & unbleached ✔️ FDA & LFGB FOOD GRADE SILICONE BAND CLOSURE ✔️ SEWN IN THE USA ✔️ SMALL SIZE : ~10\"x6,5\", fits 24oz, 32oz or 64oz mason jars ✔️ ROUNDED CORNERS: for easier straining & cleaning ✔️ PLASTIC-FREE PACKAGING ✔️ MULTI-USE : hot or ice-cold brewing coffee / loose tea, celery juice, cheese, tofu, vegetable bouillon, nut milks (fabric is tightly woven, so works only for almond milk). Also, great as soap nuts laundry bag & produce bag. ☕ HOW TO MAKE COLD BREW COFFEE 1) Place filter bag inside a wide mouth mason jar. Keep seams outside - so grounds will not stick in seams - makes cleaning easier. 2) Secure bag with an attached silicone band. It helps to add coffee grounds & water without holding the bag. 3) Add coffee grounds 4) Add water 5) Pull the drawstring to close the bag, or use a silicone band. Leave drawstring outside of the jar. 6) Close jar with lid (keeping drawstring outside) & refrigerate for about 12 hours. 7) Remove the bag from the jar, compost coffee grounds & enjoy cold brew coffee. Coffee grounds can be added to garden or lawn, yet best if composted first. 8) Rinse bag & dry in well-ventilated area. The bag comes with bag care instructions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ENZerOlML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EcoPeaceful","source_asin":"B09DX5CCTL","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-73737","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DX5CCTL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DX5CCTL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
