window.products.push({"id":73743,"name":"FAMCO Dryer Vent Cover for Home, Movable Louvers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iQGRE6YGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The FAMCO LH Plastic Wall Vents with Movable Louvers are made of polypropylene plastic for durability and longevity. They are made with UV inhibitors, giving greater stability in all weather conditions, and feature a full 1 inch collar for secure pipe attachment and their heavy duty borders ensure secure and durable mounting. This LH Wall Vent has movable louvers and is used as exhaust vents for dryer and bathroom installations. The FAMCO LH Plastic Wall Vents come in sizes that can be used on pipes measuring 4 inch, 6 inch, and 8 inch diameters. Available colors are brown and white. PLEASE NOTE: THE SIZE YOU SELECT REPRESENTS THE SIZE OF THE PIPE IT ATTACHES TO. View the Spec drawing for more sizing details. The FAMCO LH Plastic Wall vents are manufactured in the United States by FAMCO and come with a 1-year warranty that covers product defects and workmanship. If you have questions regarding this vent, please read the FAQs above or feel free contact us by phone or email. Established in 1989, Fresh Air Manufacturing Company (FAMCO), headquartered in Meridian, Idaho is one of the Pacific Northwest’s largest manufacturers of Roof Flashings, Pipe Flashings, Ventilation Products, HVAC Accessories, Plastic Air Ventilation Products, and Specialty Building Products. FAMCO builds high quality products that have been trusted by HVAC, Mechanical, Roofing, and Building Professionals for decades. Our quality starts with using the finest raw materials available and having our experienced team following lean manufacturing principles. Under Lean Manufacturing, every procedure is measured, analyzed and checked for quality, efficiency and customer satisfaction. It is the veteran management team, industry knowledge and desire to always improve that separates FAMCO from the competition. We pride ourselves on the guarantee of quality Ventilation and Building Products at FAMCO.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iQGRE6YGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FAMCO","source_asin":"B08GYZY977","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-73743","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GYZY977","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GYZY977","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
