window.products.push({"id":73893,"name":"24 Cells Egg Container for Refrigerator, DILIBRA Stackable Clear Egg Holder Egg Tray with Dust-Proof Lid and Handle, Plastic Egg Storage Organizer Bin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cq0u4oYHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍳【Stackable & Large Capacity Design】It can hold 24 eggs or duck eggs, which is safe and stable, not easy to break. The egg storage boxes can be stacked to save space and keep the refrigerator in order, so that the refrigerator will never see loose eggs again! 🍳【Practical Kitchen Storage】It can be used to hold eggs, as well as strawberries, vegetables and other foods, effectively protecting food from dust. Perfect sealing make it not only suitable for refrigerators, cabinets, cold rooms, dining tables and other places, but also very convenient for outdoor camping, picnic activities and outdoor travel. 🍳【Transparent & Durable Material】The egg rack for refrigerator is made of food-grade PET and PP materials, which are safe, healthy, and BPA-free, escorting the health of you and your family. The transparent appearance design makes the items in the storage box clear at a glance, which is convenient for you to check the surplus every day. 🍳【Easy-to-use Egg Dispenser】This versatile egg carton has built-in easy-to-grip side handles that can easily move food from the refrigerator to the counter and kitchen table. With double opening and closing design on both sides, you can easily take or store eggs with one hand.Besides, We also included a blender to free your hands. 🍳【The Do's and Don'ts】Very easy to clean, but please use mild soap and warm water to clean the surface. Not only that, it is not suitable for microwaves, ovens or dishwashers. In addition, in order to prevent dust and keep fresh, we use an unsealed 120°flip lid.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cq0u4oYHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DILIBRA","source_asin":"B09PQT7ZB1","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-73893","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PQT7ZB1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PQT7ZB1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":73894,"name":"LG : WM2455HG 27 Front-Load XL Washer - Pearl Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5137vioO9kL._AC_.jpg","description":"LG Electronics pursues its 21st century vision of becoming a true global digital leader who can make its customers worldwide happy through its innovative digital products and services. LG Electronics set its mid- and long-term vision anew to rank among the top 3 electronics, information, and telecommunication firms in the world by 2010. As such, they embrace the philosophy of Great Company, Great People, whereby only great people can create a great company, and pursue two growth strategies involving fast innovation and fast growth. Likewise, they seek to secure three core capabilities: product leadership, market leadership, and people-centered leadership. XL Front Load Stackable Washing Machine with 9 Washing Programs Ultra Capacity with NeveRust Stainless Steel Drum The largest capacity front load washer for the consumer market which means fewer loads, easy handling of large comforters and better water and energy efficiency. Intelligent Electronic Controls with Dual LED Display and Dial-A-Cycle Intuitive controls allow you to 'set it and go'. The large LCD display provides instructions and diagnostics while keeping you updated on the cycle status and time remaining. Stackable or Side by Side? Your Choice. Less space? Try stacking the washer and dryer. More space? Place them side by side or under a counter. Don't want to bend down so far to load or unload clothing? Add their tall drawer pedestals. They're also a great place to store laundry products. Sanitary Cycle Get tough stains and bacteria out of dirty clothes with this special cycle that boosts water to 158 F. Load Size Sensing Indicator Determines the size of the load so you can gauge how much detergent to use. The benefit is that you will only use the amount of detergent you need, saving you money.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5137vioO9kL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LG","source_asin":"B001212DU6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-73894","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001212DU6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B001212DU6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
