window.products.push({"id":73999,"name":"Enjoy better coffee with Keto Coffee's reusable ultra fine washable stainless steel coffee filter disk | Fits Aerobie AeroPress & Espresso Machines","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517c9wBIt-L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"SAVE MONEY AND MAKE BETTER COFFEE Running out of paper filters? Forget about that forever! Keto Coffee's stainless steel filter is specifically designed to make your life easier when brewing a grit free cup of Aeropress coffee. It will allow more of the natural oils of the coffee to pass, giving you a more nuanced and full-bodied cup you'll absolutely love. Natural coffee oils cafestol and kahweol show many anticarcinogenic properties in recent studies. Why choosing Keto Coffee's stainless steel filters? - Because you'll save money - Because you'll improve the taste of your coffee - Because they are easy to clean - Because they are environmentally friendly - Because they are acid and alkaline resistant Simply follow these instructions to improve the quality of your Aeropress brew. We recommend using the inverted brewing method but either will work. Normal brewing method: Step 1: Put the metal filter in the cap Step 2: Screw the cap with the metal filter on the Aeropress Step 3: Place 1-2 scoops of ground coffee in your Aeropress Step 4: Pour hot water over the coffee and press Step 5: Rinse your Metal Filter with water Inverted brewing method: Step 1: Put the Plunger in the Aeropress and put it upside down Step 2: Put the ground coffee in the Aeropress. (Weigh out 15-20g of medium or fine ground coffee) Step 3: Fill hot water in the Aeropress Step 4: Screw the cap with the Metal Filter on the Aeropress, turn it around and press the plunger Step 5: Rinse your Metal Filter with water. We dare to vouch for our filters saying they are the best available out there. You will not regret it. ORDER NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517c9wBIt-L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Keto Coffee","source_asin":"B01CYYVXAK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-73999","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CYYVXAK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CYYVXAK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
